# Vocabulary Hub contents for the fair2grow scenario.
#
# A Semantic Treehouse catalogue export (project "DigiLab TK FAIR2Grow") of a local STH,
# produced by sth-greenhouse-bundle/fair2grow/tools/sth_publish.py. It holds the WUR logical
# model of the FAIR2Grow export, the message model derived from SAREF4AGRI and SOSA, the two
# codelists, the five ontologies, and the element and value alignments between the models.
# The STH export is unedited. STH exports no coverage, so a hand-written coverage for the two
# alignments is appended at the end, as in the other scenarios (proposed extension). Refresh the
# export from tno.semantic-treehouse.nl once the specifications are published there; the IRIs then
# change from localhost:4200 to that host, so update the IRIs in the appended part too.

